    "Does this patient seem to be emotionally labile, show incongrouous emotions, or appear hopeless or depressed?": "affect_emotion",
    "Does this patient show easy sensory overload or avoidant behavior?": "affect_sensory",
    "Does this patient express illogical thoughts or paranoia?": "affect_paranoia",
